## Scoring Scales & Criteria

### Likelihood & Impact Definitions

| Scale Value | Likelihood Definition | Impact Definition |
| :---: | :--- | :--- |
| **1** | Unlikely | **Minor:** Small delay, easy to fix |
| **2** | Possible | **Moderate:** Affects one task or deliverable |
| **3** | Very likely | **Severe:** Affects several work packages or the final grade |

### Risk Level Ranges

| Risk Level | Score Range | Action Required |
| :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **Low** | 1 – 2 | Acceptable; monitor as needed |
| **Medium** | 3 – 5 | Manageable; requires predefined contingency actions |
| **High** | 6 – 9 | Critical; requires early prevention and immediate cross-checking |
